{"title": "Bladesong Healing Charge (Condition)", "pageid": 49025, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Has status properties", "Bugs", "Conditions", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Healing Charge Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bladesong_Healing_Charge_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Bladesong Healing Charge</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>A charge that increases how much you heal yourself and your allies by <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> when using <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong Climax\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Bladesong_Climax_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong_Climax\" title=\"Bladesong Climax\">Bladesong Climax</a>.</li>\n<li>You can accumulate these charges by attacking with weapons. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span>UID: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BLADESONG_HEALING_CHARGE</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BLADESONG_HEALING_CHARGE+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BLADESONG_HEALING_CHARGE+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/38px-Sort_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"If already applied\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png/25px-Sort_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Sort_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conditions#Stack_type\" title=\"Conditions\">If already applied</a>: add to duration\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" title=\"Status properties\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"More properties\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Status properties\">More properties</a>: <ul>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Status_properties/FreezeDuration\" title=\"Status properties/FreezeDuration\">FreezeDuration</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>A charge is not granted when attacking with an equipped <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flame Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Flame_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flame_Blade\" title=\"Flame Blade\">Flame Blade</a>, unless it has been summoned by a <a href=\"/wiki/Mephistopheles_Tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mephistopheles Tiefling\">Mephistopheles Tiefling</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Bladesong_Healing_Charge\">Sources of Bladesong Healing Charge</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/45px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/60px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/30px-Bladesong_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\">Bladesong</a></span></li>\n</ul></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195236\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2055/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 23216/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8088/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 27/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.025/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1252942/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   61.895      1 Template:Condition_page\n100.00%   61.895      1 -total\n 64.11%   39.683      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.51%   15.787      1 Template:PageSeo\n 25.18%   15.586      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 24.06%   14.892      6 Template:Icon_link\n 23.03%   14.257      6 Template:Icon_text\n 21.41%   13.253     26 Template:Trim\n 11.60%    7.179      3 Template:Template_style\n 10.91%    6.754      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:49025-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195236 and revision id 396214. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}